You're spot on. His MK:A bio reads thusly:

&amp;#x200B;

 *"This* ***unfortunate bystander*** *finds himself embroiled in an otherworldly struggle simply by being in the wrong place at the wrong time. A motion capture artist, Mokap now fights for his life-fantasy and reality have become one and the same."*

There's three ways to get the FGLK skins:

1. Beat The Gauntlet. It awards you with the story mode skin "The Exalted One";
2. Trial Towers for DLC Characters. Each tower has a different colored FGLK skin awarded at the end of the platform. Currently none of those towers are available, so you must wait for the next "Free Trial" weekend (where MK11 is free for everyone to play whether they bought the game or not);
3. Premium Shop, for krystals. Some of the skins have showed up there before, and chances are they will again - we just don't know when.
